{"id":"dfd7d9f548ab9aa9","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-grover-success-amplitude.md","title":"Exact Grover Success Amplitude","display":"thm-grover-success-amplitude — Exact Grover Success Amplitude","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-grover-success-amplitude","aliases":["28-thm-grover-success-amplitude"],"display":"thm-grover-success-amplitude — Exact Grover Success Amplitude","depends_on":["[[28-df-grover-iterate]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.4, two-reflection proof of Theorem 10.13; marked-subspace extension","source_printed_pages":"217–218","source_pdf_pages":"243–244","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-grover-success-amplitude"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-grover-success-amplitude</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-grover-success-amplitude — Exact Grover Success Amplitude"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dbdbce31ee6706a\" href=\"?note=1dbdbce31ee6706a\" title=\"28-df-grover-iterate\">28-df-grover-iterate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.4, two-reflection proof of Theorem 10.13; marked-subspace extension"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"217–218"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"243–244"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=2^n\">\\(N=2^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=f^{-1}(\\{1\\})\">\\(S=f^{-1}(\\{1\\})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=|S|\">\\(M=|S|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;M&lt;N\">\\(0&lt;M&lt;N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_f,u\">\\(G_f,u\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dbdbce31ee6706a\" href=\"?note=1dbdbce31ee6706a\" title=\"28-df-grover-iterate\">28-df-grover-iterate</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in S}|x\\rangle\">\\(a=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in S}|x\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(N-M)^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus S}|x\\rangle\">\\(b=(N-M)^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus S}|x\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=\\arcsin\\sqrt{M/N}\">\\(\\theta=\\arcsin\\sqrt{M/N}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\quad G_f^t u=\\sin((2t+1)\\theta)a+\\cos((2t+1)\\theta)b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\quad G_f^t u=\\sin((2t+1)\\theta)a+\\cos((2t+1)\\theta)b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\sum_{x\\in S}|\\langle x|G_f^tu\\rangle|^2=\\sin^2((2t+1)\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\sum_{x\\in S}|\\langle x|G_f^tu\\rangle|^2=\\sin^2((2t+1)\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在正交基(a,b)中u=(sinθ,cosθ)，O_f=diag(-1,1)，D_n=2uu^T-I。相乘给矩阵[cos2θ,sin2θ;−sin2θ,cos2θ]；归纳得到第一式，正交投影给第二式。原书展开唯一标记态，本条明确推广到已知标记子空间数目并给本地完整推导；不声称未知M时的停止策略。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4, two-reflection proof of Theorem 10.13; marked-subspace extension；印刷页 217–218；PDF 页 243–244。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Exact Grover Success Amplitude，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-grover-iterate","status":"resolved","id":"1dbdbce31ee6706a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-grover-iterate]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-grover-iterate","status":"resolved","id":"1dbdbce31ee6706a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G_f,u$ 见 [[28-df-grover-iterate]]；$a=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in S}|x\\rangle$，$b=(N-M)^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus S}|x\\rangle$；$\\theta=\\arcsin\\sqrt{M/N}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"N=2^n","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S=f^{-1}(\\{1\\})","display":false},{"tex":"M=|S|","display":false},{"tex":"0<M<N","display":false},{"tex":"G_f,u","display":false},{"tex":"a=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in S}|x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"b=(N-M)^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus S}|x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta=\\arcsin\\sqrt{M/N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\quad G_f^t u=\\sin((2t+1)\\theta)a+\\cos((2t+1)\\theta)b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\sum_{x\\in S}|\\langle x|G_f^tu\\rangle|^2=\\sin^2((2t+1)\\theta).","display":true}],"bytes":1926,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":["1dbdbce31ee6706a"]}